00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:01.422
- Welcome back y'all.

00:00:01.422 --> 00:00:04.515
Our next guest is a mesmerizing
folk singer songwriter

00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:06.529
who already has one Grammy under her belt

00:00:06.529 --> 00:00:09.066
and this year she's
nominated for three more

00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:11.368
for her latest album, "Age of Apathy."

00:00:11.368 --> 00:00:14.679
Great title. Now
performing her moving song,

00:00:14.679 --> 00:00:17.725
"Prodigal Daughter." Give
it up for Aoife O'Donovan

00:00:17.725 --> 00:00:19.288
along with Allison Russell.

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:23.332
